---
description: Prevent repository-wide scanning
alwaysApply: true
---

# Repository Reading Policy

Do not read entire repository.

Do not read internal/**.

Do not read public/**.

Do not read templates/**.

Always identify feature area first.

Examples:

Feature: Post
Allowed:

- post_handler.go
- post_service.go
- post_repository.go
- post.go

Feature: Category
Allowed:

- category_handler.go
- category_service.go
- category_repository.go
- category.go

Feature: Site Setting
Allowed:

- site_setting_handler.go
- site_setting_service.go
- site_setting_repository.go
- site_setting.go

If more than 10 files are required:

Stop and explain why.

Do not continue scanning automatically.

# Decision Making

Working code is not enough.

Also verify:

- Architecture consistency
- Reuse existing code
- Performance impact
- Cache impact
- Query impact

Never create duplicate logic if similar implementation already exists.